https://x.com/JesseForIndy/status/1786336063864086826\">Tweet by @JesseForIndy</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/JesseForIndy/status/1786336063864086826\">https://x.com/JesseForIndy/status/1786336063864086826</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1786485134184571172</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1786485134184571172\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-05-03T19:57:01Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1786492965688430609":{"a":"<p><a href=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=OLAK5uy_nkB1XbClHyWIFEWwI5JoFTDpO1WRo7YUM\">youtube.com/playlist?list=…</a></p>","m":"<h1>Post 1786492965688430609</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1786492965688430609\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-05-03T20:28:09Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>zxx</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1786496771041919186":{"a":"<p>I enrolled in the Medicare for all pilot program in Indiana in 2018. Can confirm it&#x27;s the best healthcare I&#x27;ve ever received. Not one decision was based on money and Medicaid negotiated the charges to 10-25%, denying unauthorized charges. I owed $0 of ~$350k charged, ~$75k paid. <a href=\"https://x.com/DarrigoMelanie/status/1786490815470071847\">Tweet by @DarrigoMelanie</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DarrigoMelanie/status/1786490815470071847\">https://x.com/DarrigoMelanie/status/1786490815470071847</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1786496771041919186</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1786496771041919186\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-05-03T20:43:16Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1786497269685973073":{"a":"<p>Example: Hospital bills everyone (you) $4500 per MRI, $500 for IV. Medicare for all/medicaid pays $450 for the MRI and $45 for the IV.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1786496771041919186\">https://x.com/i/status/1786496771041919186</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1786497269685973073</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1786497269685973073\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-05-03T20:45:15Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1786497436527022222":{"a":"<p>If you compare to other countries without rampant fraud in their healthcare systems this is what they pay.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1786497269685973073\">https://x.com/i/status/1786497269685973073</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1786497436527022222</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1786497436527022222\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-05-03T20:45:55Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1786497963037978866":{"a":"<p>Why do they do this? Confused people don&#x27;t realize they are being overcharged and actually try to pay a bogus million dollar charge. If the hospital is forced to reduce the price they can most likely claim the $450 paid as a $4000 loss of income on their books...</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1786497436527022222\">https://x.com/i/status/1786497436527022222</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1786497963037978866</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1786497963037978866\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-05-03T20:48:00Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1786498448230904140":{"a":"<p>my first &quot;real job&quot; was processing nightly charges at a hospital. I noticed the $50 Kleenex boxes back in the 90s. Much better today but still they are marking things up 1000% in many cases.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1786497963037978866\">https://x.com/i/status/1786497963037978866</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1786498448230904140</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1786498448230904140\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-05-03T20:49:56Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"}}